  "releaseNotes": "### Bug Fixes\n\n* address review findings on Markdown tables, images and shell highlighting ([4e050cd](https://github.com/LM-Development/ShinyPDF/commit/4e050cdec84d4fb825e68360ec3f7197a875c159))\n* limit image pixels and highlighting time for untrusted Markdown ([9bfc4bb](https://github.com/LM-Development/ShinyPDF/commit/9bfc4bb50c1043c4762d5e57a8b6e43a89076fdd))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* add tables, task lists, images, alerts and syntax highlighting to Markdown ([f773fa6](https://github.com/LM-Development/ShinyPDF/commit/f773fa65e839a476c2db83a416288bb48f3863b5)), closes [#33](https://github.com/LM-Development/ShinyPDF/issues/33)",
